            "Covariance[2,2] mismatch: {} vs {}", covariance[(2, 2)], expected_zz);

        println!("  ✓ Diagonal values match expected: ({:.3e}, {:.3e}, {:.3e})",
            expected_xx, expected_yy, expected_zz);

        println!();
    }

